  title: "Alfie's letter to Jamie"
  body: "Dear Jamie,\n\n\nI am getting worried about your sickness and wanted to help you out.\n\n\nMy family friend works at this hospital, and I managed to get you a free slot at the hospital. Their research methods are outstanding, and their success rate is 99%.\n\n\nPlease consider it. I am sending you their contacts. "
